Description: GNOME app showing the state of zark backups
 Shows how zark's backups stand: how full the system pools are, each
 backup drive with its last backup, its space and its backup points by
 month, the datasets left out of backups, and a backup running in a
 terminal, with its progress.
 .
 It reads the status files the installed zark writes and needs no
 administrator password. This version changes nothing: where an action
 belongs, its button copies the zark command to run in a terminal.
